# --- App settings with local/secrets content ---
# Keep appsettings.json as a committed template, but never commit
# environment-specific values or secrets. Use user-secrets
# (dotnet user-secrets) or environment variables for the real values.
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.json

# --- Misc ---
#.editorconfig
#.gitattributes
